Bolt of Glory	SCHOOL:Evocation	DESCRIPTOR:Good	COMPS:V, S, DF	CASTTIME:1 standard action	RANGE:Close	TARGETAREA:Ray	DURATION:Instantaneous	SAVEINFO:None	SPELLRES:Yes	CLASSES:Exalted Arcanist=6	DOMAINS:Glory=6	DESC:By casting this spell, you project a bolt of energy from the Positive Energy Plane against one creature. You must succeed on a ranged touch attack to strike your target. A creature struck takes varying damage, depending on its nature and home plane of existence: Creature's Origin Damage Material Plane 5d8 Elemental, neutral outsider 5d6 Positive Energy Plane, good outsider none Evil outsider, undead creature 10d8 Negative Energy Plane 15d8	SOURCEPAGE:p.92
