Rain of Black Tulips	TYPE:Divine	SCHOOL:Evocation	DESCRIPTOR:Good	COMPS:V, S, M	CASTTIME:1 standard action	RANGE:Long	TARGETAREA:Cylinder (80-ft. radius, 80 ft. high)	DURATION:(CASTERLEVEL) rounds [D]	SAVEINFO:None (damage) and Fortitude negates (nausea)	SPELLRES:Yes	SOURCEPAGE:p.104
Rain of Embers	TYPE:Sanctified	SCHOOL:Evocation	DESCRIPTOR:Fire|Good	COMPS:V, S, Sacrifice	CASTTIME:1 standard action	RANGE:Medium	TARGETAREA:Cylinder (40-ft. radius, 120 ft. high)	DURATION:(CASTERLEVEL) rounds [D]	SAVEINFO:Reflex half; see text	SPELLRES:Yes	SOURCEPAGE:p.104
Rain of Roses	TYPE:Divine	SCHOOL:Evocation	DESCRIPTOR:Good	COMPS:V, S, M	CASTTIME:1 standard action	RANGE:Long	TARGETAREA:Cylinder (80-ft. radius, 80 ft. high)	DURATION:(CASTERLEVEL) rounds [D]	SAVEINFO:None (ability damage) and Fortitude negates (sickening)	SPELLRES:Yes	SOURCEPAGE:p.105
Ray of Hope	SCHOOL:Enchantment	SUBSCHOOL:Compulsion	DESCRIPTOR:Good|Mind-Affecting	COMPS:V, S	CASTTIME:1 standard action	RANGE:Close	TARGETAREA:One living creature	DURATION:(CASTERLEVEL) rounds	SAVEINFO:Will negates (harmless)	SPELLRES:Yes (harmless)	SOURCEPAGE:p.105
Refreshment	SCHOOL:Conjuration	SUBSCHOOL:Healing	DESCRIPTOR:Good	COMPS:V, S	CASTTIME:1 standard action	RANGE:20 ft.	TARGETAREA:20-ft.-radius burst centered on you	DURATION:Instantaneous	SAVEINFO:Will negates (harmless)	SPELLRES:Yes (harmless)	SOURCEPAGE:p.105
Remove Addiction	SCHOOL:Conjuration	SUBSCHOOL:Healing	COMPS:V, S	CASTTIME:1 standard action	RANGE:Touch	TARGETAREA:One creature touched	DURATION:Instantaneous	SAVEINFO:Fortitude negates (harmless)	SPELLRES:Yes (harmless)	SOURCEPAGE:p.105
Remove Fatigue	SCHOOL:Transmutation	COMPS:S	CASTTIME:10 minutes	RANGE:Touch	TARGETAREA:Up to one living creature touched per two levels	DURATION:Instantaneous	SAVEINFO:Fortitude negates (harmless)	SPELLRES:Yes (harmless)	CLASSES:Apostle of Peace,Cleric=4	DOMAINS:Pleasure=4	DESC:The creatures you touch gain the benefits of 8 hours of restful sleep. If a subject was fatigued, the fatigue and its penalties are removed. If a subject was exhausted, the exhaustion becomes fatigue, but the subject only needs to rest for 1 more hour to eliminate the fatigue. If a subject was already well rested, it does not need to rest or sleep during the next 24 hours. Arcane spellcasters must still rest their minds for 8 hours in order to prepare or ready their spells.	SOURCEPAGE:p.105
Remove Nausea	SCHOOL:Conjuration	SUBSCHOOL:Healing	COMPS:V, DF	CASTTIME:1 standard action	RANGE:Touch	TARGETAREA:Creature touched	DURATION:Instantaneous	SAVEINFO:Will negates (harmless)	SPELLRES:Yes (harmless)	SOURCEPAGE:p.105
Restore Soul's Treasure	TYPE:Sanctified	SCHOOL:Transmutation	COMPS:Sacrifice	CASTTIME:1 round	RANGE:Close	TARGETAREA:Disintegrated remains of one item	DURATION:Instantaneous	SAVEINFO:None	SPELLRES:No	SOURCEPAGE:p.105
Righteous Glare	TYPE:Arcane.Divine	SCHOOL:Necromancy	DESCRIPTOR:Death|Good	COMPS:V, S	CASTTIME:1 standard action	RANGE:Personal	TARGETAREA:You	DURATION:(CASTERLEVEL) rounds	SOURCEPAGE:p.105
Righteous Smite	SCHOOL:Evocation	DESCRIPTOR:Good	COMPS:V, S	CASTTIME:1 standard action	RANGE:Medium	TARGETAREA:20-ft. radius spread	DURATION:Instantaneous	SAVEINFO:Will partial; see text	SPELLRES:Yes	SOURCEPAGE:p.106
Sacred Guardian	SCHOOL:Divination	COMPS:V, S, Celestial	CASTTIME:1 standard action	RANGE:Touch	TARGETAREA:Object or willing creature touched	DURATION:(CASTERLEVEL) days	SAVEINFO:None (see text)	SPELLRES:Yes (harmless)	SOURCEPAGE:p.106
Sacred Haven	TYPE:Divine	SCHOOL:Abjuration	COMPS:V, S, DF	CASTTIME:1 standard action	RANGE:Touch	TARGETAREA:Creature touched	DURATION:(CASTERLEVEL) minutes	SAVEINFO:Will negates (harmless)	SPELLRES:Yes (harmless)	CLASSES:Paladin=4	DESC:You shield one creature in a nimbus of holy light. The creature gains a +2 sacred bonus to Armor Class. In addition, while protected by this spell, the creature does not lose its Dexterity bonus to AC when flat-footed. For the duration of the spell, you gain awareness of the target's health as with the status spell, and you need not be able to touch the target to heal it with your lay on hands ability. Use of the lay on hands ability still requires a standard action, but it can be done at any range provided the target is on the same plane of existence as you.	SOURCEPAGE:p.106
Sanctify the Wicked	TYPE:Sanctified	SCHOOL:Necromancy	DESCRIPTOR:Good	COMPS:V, S, F, Sacrifice	CASTTIME:1 standard action	RANGE:Close	TARGETAREA:One evil creature	DURATION:See text	SAVEINFO:Will negates	SPELLRES:Yes	SOURCEPAGE:p.106
Second Wind	TYPE:Divine	SCHOOL:Transmutation	COMPS:V, S, DF	CASTTIME:1 standard action	RANGE:Touch	TARGETAREA:Creature touched	DURATION:(CASTERLEVEL) hours	SAVEINFO:Will negates (harmless)	SPELLRES:Yes (harmless)	CLASSES:Paladin=1	DESC:For the duration of the spell, the target can perform long-term strenuous activity as though it had the Endurance feat.	SOURCEPAGE:p.106
Secure Corpse	TYPE:Divine	SCHOOL:Necromancy	COMPS:V, S, DF	CASTTIME:1 standard action	RANGE:Close	TARGETAREA:Stores one creature's corpse in your holy symbol	DURATION:(CASTERLEVEL) days [D]	SAVEINFO:None	SPELLRES:No	SOURCEPAGE:p.106
Shield of the Archons	SCHOOL:Abjuration	DESCRIPTOR:Good	COMPS:V, Archon	CASTTIME:1 standard action	RANGE:Personal	TARGETAREA:You	TARGETAREA:Mobile shield	DURATION:(CASTERLEVEL) rounds	SOURCEPAGE:p.107
Sicken Evil	TYPE:Sanctified	SCHOOL:Necromancy	DESCRIPTOR:Good	COMPS:V, S, Sacrifice	CASTTIME:1 standard action	RANGE:Personal	TARGETAREA:20-ft.-radius emanation	DURATION:(CASTERLEVEL) minutes [D]	SAVEINFO:None	SPELLRES:Yes	SOURCEPAGE:p.107
Silvered Claws	TYPE:Divine	SCHOOL:Transmutation	COMPS:V, S, DF	CASTTIME:1 standard action	RANGE:Touch	TARGETAREA:One living creature touched	DURATION:(CASTERLEVEL) minutes	SAVEINFO:Will negates (harmless)	SPELLRES:Yes (harmless)	SOURCEPAGE:p.107
Silvered Weapon	TYPE:Divine	SCHOOL:Transmutation	COMPS:V, S	CASTTIME:1 standard action	RANGE:Touch	TARGETAREA:One weapon or projectile touched	DURATION:(CASTERLEVEL) rounds	SAVEINFO:Fortitude negates (object, harmless)	SPELLRES:Yes (object, harmless)	SOURCEPAGE:p.107
Smite Heretic	TYPE:Divine	SCHOOL:Conjuration	COMPS:V, S, DF	CASTTIME:1 standard action	RANGE:Personal	TARGETAREA:You	DURATION:(CASTERLEVEL*10) minutes	SOURCEPAGE:p.107
Spear of Valarian	SCHOOL:Transmutation	COMPS:V, S	CASTTIME:1 standard action	RANGE:Touch	TARGETAREA:One nonmagical weapon touched	DURATION:(CASTERLEVEL) rounds [D]	SAVEINFO:Fortitude negates (object, harmless)	SPELLRES:Yes (object, harmless)	SOURCEPAGE:p.107
Spread of Contentment	TYPE:Divine	SCHOOL:Enchantment	SUBSCHOOL:Compulsion	DESCRIPTOR:Mind- Affecting	COMPS:V, S, M	CASTTIME:1 hour	RANGE:Long	TARGETAREA:10 ft./level-radius spread	DURATION:(CASTERLEVEL) hours [D]	SAVEINFO:None	SPELLRES:Yes	SOURCEPAGE:p.107
Starmantle	TYPE:Arcane.Divine	SCHOOL:Abjuration	COMPS:V, S, M	CASTTIME:1 standard action	RANGE:Touch	TARGETAREA:One living creature touched	DURATION:(CASTERLEVEL) minutes [D]	SAVEINFO:None	SPELLRES:Yes (harmless)	SOURCEPAGE:p.108
Stars of Arvandor	TYPE:Arcane.Divine	SCHOOL:Evocation	DESCRIPTOR:Force|Good	COMPS:V, S	CASTTIME:1 standard action	RANGE:Close	TARGETAREA:Up to one creature or object per round	DURATION:(CASTERLEVEL) minutes [D]	SAVEINFO:None	SPELLRES:Yes	CLASSES:Sorcerer,Wizard=3|Cleric,Druid,Ranger=4	DESC:You create one tiny, twinkling star per level (maximum 10 stars). These minute starbursts orbit your head like ioun stones. As a free action, you can launch one star per round at a target your designate within range. Alternatively, as a standard action, you may launch up to three stars per round at one or more targets within range. Each star requires its own ranged touch attack roll. A nonevil target takes 1d8 points of damage, half of which is nonlethal (round down). Evil targets take 1d8 points of lethal damage instead. The stars are magical force, so they ignore incorporeality.	SOURCEPAGE:p.108
Storm of Shards	TYPE:Sanctified	SCHOOL:Evocation	DESCRIPTOR:Good	COMPS:V, S, Sacrifice	CASTTIME:1 standard action	RANGE:0 ft.	TARGETAREA:80-ft.-radius spread	DURATION:Instantaneous	SAVEINFO:Fortitude negates (blinding) and Reflex half (shards)	SPELLRES:Yes	SOURCEPAGE:p.108
Sublime Revelry	TYPE:Divine	SCHOOL:Abjuration	COMPS:V, S, DF	CASTTIME:1 round	RANGE:Close	TARGETAREA:One creature/level, no two of which can be more than 30 ft. apart	DURATION:(CASTERLEVEL) minutes [D]	SAVEINFO:None	SPELLRES:No	SOURCEPAGE:p.108
Sunmantle	TYPE:Sanctified	SCHOOL:Abjuration	COMPS:S, Sacrifice	CASTTIME:1 standard action	RANGE:Touch	TARGETAREA:One creature touched	DURATION:(CASTERLEVEL) rounds	SAVEINFO:None	SPELLRES:Yes	SOURCEPAGE:p.108
Sustain	SCHOOL:Transmutation	COMPS:V, S, M	CASTTIME:1 round	RANGE:Touch	TARGETAREA:Up to one living creature touched/two levels	DURATION:(CASTERLEVEL*6) hours	SAVEINFO:None	SPELLRES:Yes (harmless)	CLASSES:Apostle of Peace,Cleric=4	DOMAINS:Endurance=4	DESC:This spell instantly relieves the negative effects of hunger and thirst and allows the targets to go without food or water for the duration of the spell, suffering no ill effects from the deprivation. An affected creature can eat or drink normally without difficulty. When the spell ends, the creatures must resume normal eating and drinking habits, but do not feel any adverse effects from the missed meals. The size of the creature is not a factor; a Tiny lizard and a Colossal dragon are both fully nourished by the spell. Material Component: A flask of warm wine and a loaf of bread.	SOURCEPAGE:p.108
Sword of Conscience	SCHOOL:Enchantment	SUBSCHOOL:Compulsion	DESCRIPTOR:Good|Mind-Affecting	COMPS:V, DF	CASTTIME:1 standard action	RANGE:Close	TARGETAREA:One evil creature	DURATION:Instantaneous; see text	SAVEINFO:Will negates	SPELLRES:Yes	SOURCEPAGE:p.108
Telepathy Block	TYPE:Arcane.Divine	SCHOOL:Abjuration	COMPS:V, S	CASTTIME:1 standard action	RANGE:Close	TARGETAREA:80-ft.-radius emanation centered on a creature, object, or point in space	DURATION:(CASTERLEVEL) rounds [D]	SAVEINFO:None	SPELLRES:No	SOURCEPAGE:p.108
Telepathy Tap	TYPE:Sanctified	SCHOOL:Divination	COMPS:Sacrifice	CASTTIME:1 standard action	RANGE:Personal	TARGETAREA:10-ft./level-radius emanation	DURATION:(CASTERLEVEL) rounds [D]	SAVEINFO:None	SPELLRES:No	SOURCEPAGE:p.110
Tomb of Light	TYPE:Arcane.Divine	SCHOOL:Transmutation	DESCRIPTOR:Good	COMPS:V, S, M	CASTTIME:1 round	RANGE:Touch	TARGETAREA:Evil extraplanar creature touched	DURATION:Concentration	SAVEINFO:Fortitude partial	SPELLRES:Yes	SOURCEPAGE:p.110
Touch of Adamantine	TYPE:Arcane.Divine	SCHOOL:Transmutation	COMPS:V, S	CASTTIME:1 standard action	RANGE:Touch	TARGETAREA:Weapon touched	DURATION:(CASTERLEVEL) minutes	SAVEINFO:Will negates (object, harmless)	SPELLRES:Yes (object, harmless)	SOURCEPAGE:p.110
